        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer LB4310C-350, 3-1/2\" x 3-1/2\"  x Square Corner Heavy Duty Spring Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged complete with a Pair (2) Single Action Spring Door Hinges, Tension Adjusting Tool, Locking Pins plus #10 x 3/4\" Wood  Screws and #10-24 x 1/2\" machine screws. Utilizes ANSI template screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBommer spring hinges are UL Listed for fire door applications, certified Grade 1 (highest grade) for 1 million cycles and made in the USA. Pivot point aligns with residential butt hinges gage .123 to .134\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe included Tension Tool is use to adjust spring tension. The Locking Pins hold the Spring in tension after it is set. These adjustable tension spring hinges allow you to determine how much closing force you apply  to the door (how hard/fast the door self closes). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications </b> for Bommer LB4310C-350 Spring Hinge\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Durable Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square Corners</li>\r\n<li>Gauge of Metal: .130 (Heavy Duty)</li>\r\n<li>Number of Holes: 6</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #10-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Spring Torque</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed R-4667 653M for fire door applications.</li>\r\n<li>BHMA Certified <b>Grade 1</b> for 1 million cycles.</li>\r\n<li>Full Mortise - ANSI K81071F</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LB4310c-350.pdf?v=1691094995\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer LB4310C-350 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a pair (2 Hinges).</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** This item is DISCONTINUED.  None available.</b>\r\n</p>",
